---
smd: 2
title: Closing fences in spec v2
summary: "Pins how spec v2 pairs closing fences with containers by colon count (RFC proposal 3): a closing fence closes the innermost container opened with as many colons, and the containers inside it close with it; a fence that matches no container closes the innermost one. Read with `smd: 1`, every closing fence closes the innermost container; the unit tests compare both."
status: draft
updated: 2026-10-17
---

